# Local Claude state and instruction overlays may contain machine-specific
# prompts, session data, or private operational context. These paths are a
# permanent version-control boundary: never add, stage, commit, or mirror them
# into the distributable product source.
.claude/
*.claude
[Cc][Ll][Aa][Uu][Dd][Ee].md

# Local Cursor workspace state may contain caches, private architecture notes,
# or editor-specific context. The whole tree is permanently local-only.
# Internal development memory must never be copied into public documentation.
.cursor/
[Cc][Uu][Rr][Ss][Oo][Rr].md

